# Themes offered on a child install (kids mode), one theme directory name per
# line; the first is the theme a child install starts on. The theme switcher
# and `omarchy theme list` show only these on a child install, plus anything
# the kid puts under ~/.config/omarchy/themes; a "Me" install offers every
# theme. To offer a child-friendly theme, add it under themes/ and name it
# here.
bubblegum
catppuccin-latte
flexoki-light
rose-pine
everforest
nord
